abstract: >-
  Versioned data, code, figures, and reproducibility records for a comparative
  analysis of vertebrate DNMT3L evolution centered on a sampled muroid LFI
  state at NP105/NP106/NP107, matched partner-side conservation, locus
  evidence, ancestral reconstruction, and alignment sensitivity.
keywords:
  - DNMT3L
  - molecular evolution
  - comparative genomics
  - G9a
  - EHMT2
  - DNA methylation
  - ancestral reconstruction
